<title>LATVIA: BOURSE DELISTS TUKUMS FOR DISCLOSURE VIOLATION.</title>
<headline>BOURSE DELISTS TUKUMS FOR DISCLOSURE VIOLATION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Riga stock exchange said on Thursday it delisted Tukums Forestry, quoted on its free list, for failing to disclose its 1996 annual report data.</p>
<p>The latest figures Tukums has submitted cover the first nine months of 1996. They show a loss of 193,000 lats on turnover of 272,550 lats, a bourse spokesperson told Reuters.</p>
<p>The spokesperson added that the company would be listed again after it submitted the necessary data.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
